              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 6:22-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ni Aaroni baingira mu Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda. Bwe baafuluma, baasabira abantu enkabi, era ekitiisa kya Musengwa Katonda ekimesunkana kyabonekera abantu boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amangu ago Musengwa Katonda yaasindika omuliro, gwayokya ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa era n'amasavu ku alutaari. Abantu bwe baagubona, boonaboona baawowoigana, baakutama n'ebyeni byatuuka ku itaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
